sequenceDiagram
    autonumber 10 5
    participant A as Client<br/>App
    actor B as Operator
    participant C
    A->>B: first line<br>second line
    Note over B: single over<br/>two lines
    loop retry until done
        B-)C: poll
        opt has work
            C--)B: job
            B->>B: process
        end
    end
    autonumber off
    C-->>A: result
    Note right of C: right of last
